# AB-023: Hydroxide equivalents depend on formula stoichiometry
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 HCl 0.002mol
add v1 NaOH 0.001mol
measure v1 ph
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 HCl 0.002mol
add v2 Ca(OH)2 0.001mol
measure v2 ph
inspect
